Subject: [PATCH 73/73] Freeciv45: a city that needs production opens its
 chooser

With the Freeciv45 layout on, during the player's own phase and while the
game window is active, a city that finished its build with nothing
queued, or was just founded, centres the map on itself and opens its
production chooser beside it. After a pick the next such city opens;
closing a chooser without a pick stops this for the rest of the turn.
The city overlay showing a new city does not count as having chosen. The
"City needs production" button opens the chooser too, instead of the
city dialog. Issue 373.
